{{Cuisine of Indonesia}}

'''Javanese cuisine''' ({{langx|jv|ꦥꦔꦤ꧀ꦤꦤ꧀ꦗꦮ|panganan jawa}}) is the cuisine of [[Javanese people]], a major [[Native Indonesians|ethnic group]] in Indonesia in the [[Provinces of Indonesia|provinces]] of [[Central Java]], [[Special Region of Yogyakarta|Yogyakarta]], and [[East Java]].
